      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The engineered coherent nanoprecipitates form uniformly throughout the alloy.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent SCCP interfaces facilitate dislocation transmission.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent SCCP interfaces relieve local stress concentrations.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relieving stress concentrations suppresses premature crack initiation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "SCCPs facilitate sustained plastic deformation and thereby improve ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Suppressing premature crack initiation allows the SCCP-containing alloy to maintain high strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under cyclic or high-strain-rate loading, the SCCP-engineered alloy will have higher dynamic flow strength than the baseline alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under cyclic or high-strain-rate loading, the SCCP-engineered alloy will fail later than the baseline alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Under cyclic or high-strain-rate loading, the SCCP-engineered alloy will have greater ductility than the baseline alloy.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The predicted dynamic benefits will persist from ambient temperature to approximately 800 °C.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "A precipitate-free baseline will have lower dynamic strength and ductility.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The precipitate-free baseline undergoes earlier dislocation pile-up than the SCCP-engineered alloy.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The mechanism should apply generally to refractory HEAs that develop coherent nanoprecipitates.",
